reviews.review:
This is a result of Nexon having a orgy party and inviting destiny and warframe to party along.

Pros:
Destiny visuals;
Destiny combat;
Warframe item/class building;
Warframe quantity of ways to improve yourself.

Cons:
Warframe level of grind;
Warframe crafting system;
Warframe levels of repetition;
Destiny like PC port that has alot of console features in UI.

Neutral:
Crossplay seeing alot more console players than PC ones;
Everything non cosmetic can be bought or grinded, for a nexon game the drop rates feels strangely good.
